WEBVTT

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:13.013
It looks like it's still happening...

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:15.558
Attacks on Japan's airports...

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:19.353
If they declare that they're
going to create Xanadu in Japan,

00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:22.773
the Flame Hazes who want to
keep the Denizens from escaping

00:00:22.982 --> 00:00:25.568
will try to stop them.

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:28.571
Even if they've been
told not to eat people,

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:31.073
it's still a huge bother.

00:00:57.474 --> 00:01:01.687
<i>This is me. My hair streams across...</i>

00:01:01.896 --> 00:01:06.275
<i>...my cheeks dyed red</i>

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:10.446
<i>I am me... A grain of determination</i>

00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:15.201
<i>That was how it began</i>

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:25.836
<i>If there is a tomorrow that is not
hazed over by hope or despair,</i>

00:01:26.045 --> 00:01:27.213
<i>(simple as that)</i>

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:29.715
<i>I will not forget</i>

00:01:29.924 --> 00:01:35.262
<i>This pain is the promise we made that day</i>

00:01:35.471 --> 00:01:38.265
<i>I want to make it come true, I can't, I will</i>

00:01:38.474 --> 00:01:45.231
<i>At night I grab the void and awaken
to something in the morning</i>

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:55.199
<i>I merely soar into the endless sky,
taking the shackles called "reason" Yes,</i>

00:01:55.407 --> 00:01:59.161
<i>"That is all.</i> "

00:02:08.963 --> 00:02:13.550
What happened to the Flame Hazes'
task of protecting the world's balance?

00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:18.389
At least the Denizens know
when the time isn't right for fighting!

00:02:18.597 --> 00:02:20.891
There are some
things you shouldn't say.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.559
Speaking of what we should know,

00:02:22.768 --> 00:02:25.646
don't you know that you're only
alive because the Flame Hazes

00:02:25.854 --> 00:02:26.814
have been protecting the world?

00:02:27.022 --> 00:02:29.275
Don't act like we owe you anything.

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:31.694
We know you've protected us.

00:02:31.902 --> 00:02:35.281
But telling us just
to ignore this is insane.

00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:37.408
And that isn't what we're saying.

00:02:37.616 --> 00:02:41.036
I was prepared for this,
but I didn't expect it to be so bad...

00:02:41.245 --> 00:02:45.582
Choosing a discussion site where it
wouldn't be face to face was pointless.

00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:50.504
Seduced by a coward's peace,
and lost to the madness of terror.

00:02:50.713 --> 00:02:52.798
Both are so very human.

00:02:53.924 --> 00:02:58.262
The Creator God
may start at any moment.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.724
But everyone
takes advantage of the chaos

00:03:01.932 --> 00:03:04.226
to say whatever they want.

00:03:05.644 --> 00:03:09.398
Once they've spoken their minds,
they'll return all power to her.

00:03:09.606 --> 00:03:11.859
They'll ask her to lead them once again.

00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:16.071
Thus, none attempt
to blame her for the loss.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.990
None could.

00:03:18.574 --> 00:03:20.326
What a farce.

00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:23.370
It's an insult to the
ones who are actually fighting.

00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:26.623
As I've no interest in the discussion,

00:03:26.832 --> 00:03:29.418
I will simply wait for them to finish.

00:03:33.672 --> 00:03:36.675
"For Whose Sake?"

00:03:43.015 --> 00:03:45.017
Outlaw's done for.

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:47.394
They're putting that
much effort into watching us?

00:03:47.603 --> 00:03:50.856
Well, I did expect it.

00:03:51.065 --> 00:03:53.776
We just got whipped in a huge fight.
Naturally, they're on edge.

00:03:53.984 --> 00:03:55.361
And they've all

00:03:55.569 --> 00:03:59.490
gotten good and drunk
on the wine Yuji gave them.

00:03:59.698 --> 00:04:02.242
And they'll stay
drunk for a good long while.

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:05.454
Yuji Sakai.

00:04:05.662 --> 00:04:08.165
Throughout history,
not even many slayers

00:04:08.374 --> 00:04:11.210
have had such brutal genius.

00:04:11.418 --> 00:04:17.174
I suppose his special background caused
his talents to develop in unusual ways.

00:04:17.383 --> 00:04:19.218
Okay, it's open.

00:04:20.719 --> 00:04:24.056
I'd say there are
approximately eighty-two layers.

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:25.641
My! my...

00:04:25.849 --> 00:04:29.144
Every single part is constructed
with unimaginable precision.

00:04:29.353 --> 00:04:30.896
Without the scroll of secrets,

00:04:31.105 --> 00:04:34.066
even analyzing
it would take decades.

00:04:45.369 --> 00:04:46.995
Shana-san.

00:04:47.204 --> 00:04:49.748
Was this your first time in New York?

00:04:49.957 --> 00:04:50.624
Yes.

00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:52.626
I've been to America several times,

00:04:52.835 --> 00:04:55.963
but never to any of the
cities where the Four Gods live.

00:05:00.426 --> 00:05:03.554
Getting her to talk is hard.

00:05:03.762 --> 00:05:07.224
She isn't shy, is she?

00:05:13.522 --> 00:05:15.357
This is good!

00:05:15.566 --> 00:05:16.984
I'm glad...

00:05:17.192 --> 00:05:18.485
<i>Oh. "W-</i>

00:05:18.694 --> 00:05:21.780
A single raspberry makes
her suddenly turn cute.

00:05:21.989 --> 00:05:22.990
Yeah!

00:05:23.198 --> 00:05:26.702
She's more like the contractor for
an angel than for the God of Atonement.

00:05:27.828 --> 00:05:29.663
How about a blueberry?

00:05:29.872 --> 00:05:32.040
There's pineapple, too.

00:05:34.042 --> 00:05:35.627
Thank you.

00:05:35.836 --> 00:05:39.840
I get it... She was nervous.

00:05:40.048 --> 00:05:41.925
I guess I can see why.

00:05:42.134 --> 00:05:46.096
She's at the forefront of a battle
that will decide the fate of the world.

00:05:50.642 --> 00:05:52.811
The flight's here.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.354
Let's go.

00:05:54.563 --> 00:05:55.772
Yeah.

00:05:55.981 --> 00:05:57.524
Are you okay, miss?

00:05:57.733 --> 00:05:58.984
Cheer up, okay?

00:05:59.193 --> 00:06:00.819
Thank you...

00:06:01.028 --> 00:06:03.739
And you were all
so kind on the way here...

00:06:03.947 --> 00:06:05.157
Not at all.

00:06:05.365 --> 00:06:06.742
Here, wipe your tears.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:08.827
Hey, fellow travelers.

00:06:09.036 --> 00:06:11.288
We're done here. Get lost.

00:06:11.497 --> 00:06:11.914
Goodbye.

00:06:12.122 --> 00:06:12.414
Be well.

00:06:12.623 --> 00:06:14.458
Farewell.

00:06:15.876 --> 00:06:16.502
Hey.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.003
Doing well,

00:06:18.212 --> 00:06:19.963
Fluttering eyes and flashing arrow?

00:06:20.172 --> 00:06:23.634
Yes. I'm glad you're well, also.

00:06:23.842 --> 00:06:27.054
And I've never seen you before.

00:06:27.262 --> 00:06:30.641
I am the priest of Tezcatlipoca,
the Pipe of Hesitation and Fear.

00:06:30.849 --> 00:06:33.227
And the Man who
Shows the Path of the Dead.

00:06:33.435 --> 00:06:35.270
As a Flame Haze,
my name is Southvalley,

00:06:35.479 --> 00:06:37.898
the Evoker of Demon Horde.

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:39.399
MN'

00:06:39.608 --> 00:06:40.817
You...

00:06:41.026 --> 00:06:42.819
You are the child
entrusted with the future

00:06:43.028 --> 00:06:46.865
by the Drum of Exceptional Love
and He Who Walks with the Rain.

00:06:47.074 --> 00:06:49.493
I am the priestess of
the Bell of Cleansing Flutter,

00:06:49.701 --> 00:06:51.912
Chalciuhtlicue.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:54.289
I am She Who Dances
Before the Surging Sea,

00:06:54.498 --> 00:06:59.127
also known as the Whirler
of Mighty Waves, Westshore.

00:06:59.336 --> 00:07:02.756
Deity of providence, avatar
of judgment and condemnation,

00:07:02.965 --> 00:07:06.927
Great Flame of the Heavens,
lam honored to meet you.

00:07:07.135 --> 00:07:07.886
Indeed.

00:07:08.095 --> 00:07:12.099
We thank you for coming
with such short notice.

00:07:12.307 --> 00:07:13.100
However...

00:07:13.308 --> 00:07:19.273
It has not yet been decided if
I will be entrusted with the future.

00:07:21.191 --> 00:07:22.776
Twenty percent of
the Flame Hazes survived,

00:07:22.985 --> 00:07:27.656
with the help of the Beckoner of Brightened
Dew and the Drum of Exceptional Love.

00:07:27.864 --> 00:07:31.910
I wish to fulfill the
covenant I made with them,

00:07:32.119 --> 00:07:34.496
by striking at the
enemy forces' heart myself.

00:07:34.705 --> 00:07:35.664
However,

00:07:35.872 --> 00:07:41.461
the plan I've devised
may go against their wishes.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:45.048
This plan incorporates
my personal feelings, as well.

00:07:45.257 --> 00:07:48.969
It is only the conclusion of Shana,
the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer.

00:07:49.177 --> 00:07:52.556
If you still wish to fight with us,

00:07:52.764 --> 00:07:54.141
I shall explain the details.

00:07:54.349 --> 00:07:56.810
If you do not,

00:07:57.019 --> 00:07:59.730
we shall leave alone.

00:08:04.735 --> 00:08:09.197
Miss, you seem to be
misunderstanding something.

00:08:10.198 --> 00:08:12.034
The Gods of the Earth

00:08:12.242 --> 00:08:15.203
aren't as noble as
the other Flame Hazes.

00:08:16.496 --> 00:08:19.541
You needn't talk about the great task.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.752
We are all strange.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:25.422
Even amidst this chaos,
we will choose the path we follow.

00:08:25.631 --> 00:08:29.259
The personal feelings you
seem to feel are a disadvantage

00:08:29.468 --> 00:08:32.095
are the exact reason we take action.

00:08:32.304 --> 00:08:35.098
The interaction between
Crimson Denizens and humanity

00:08:35.307 --> 00:08:38.935
has been a part of the natural order,
defining our world since ancient times.

00:08:39.144 --> 00:08:43.273
The Creator God's actions
are but another example of this.

00:08:43.482 --> 00:08:47.653
However, we shall
not simply accept them.

00:08:47.861 --> 00:08:50.280
Having examined these
acts in light of the greater truth,

00:08:50.489 --> 00:08:52.407
we have decided to fight.

00:08:52.866 --> 00:08:56.870
If the Creator God were to
take all the Denizens and leave,

00:08:57.079 --> 00:09:01.541
the power of existence they
currently hold would return to the world.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.835
The world would be stable for
a long time to come.

00:09:04.044 --> 00:09:06.713
But their dangerous
actions in the new world,

00:09:06.922 --> 00:09:09.216
Xanadu, would only increase.

00:09:09.424 --> 00:09:13.804
Since it'd be a paradise created for them,

00:09:14.012 --> 00:09:15.722
there'd be no need to hold back.

00:09:15.931 --> 00:09:17.766
Thus, we must

00:09:17.974 --> 00:09:22.938
prevent this from happening,
to protect what we call the world

00:09:23.146 --> 00:09:25.816
from the disaster that awaits.

00:09:31.238 --> 00:09:33.615
Let's hear it, miss...

00:09:34.366 --> 00:09:37.536
The words entrusted to you
by the Drum of Exceptional Love

00:09:37.744 --> 00:09:40.163
and He who Walks With the Rain.

00:09:44.209 --> 00:09:46.086
"I have become a drop of rain,

00:09:46.294 --> 00:09:49.256
and sacrificed myself,
to force you to act.

00:09:49.798 --> 00:09:52.426
And my friends...

00:09:53.844 --> 00:09:56.555
...the decision to fight

00:09:56.763 --> 00:10:00.225
is the right one, without doubt."

00:10:03.478 --> 00:10:06.606
The decision to fight...

00:10:06.815 --> 00:10:09.484
Which of them made the choice?

00:10:11.778 --> 00:10:14.531
It's decided, then. We'll go with you.

00:10:15.949 --> 00:10:18.034
I'll explain the plan.

00:10:21.037 --> 00:10:23.331
Um, excuse me...

00:10:30.922 --> 00:10:32.841
Goodbye, then.

00:10:33.049 --> 00:10:35.510
If there's anything
I can do, please let me know.

00:10:35.719 --> 00:10:36.887
Thank you.

00:10:37.095 --> 00:10:40.182
I'll ask for just enough
to avoid being a burden.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:42.142
Be careful on your way back, everyone.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.436
Yes. Thanks for the meal.

00:10:44.644 --> 00:10:46.021
Goodbye.

00:10:46.229 --> 00:10:47.397
Excuse us.

00:10:47.397 --> 00:10:49.524
"Sakai"

00:10:49.524 --> 00:10:50.150
Bye.

00:11:03.455 --> 00:11:04.247
Jeez“.

00:11:04.456 --> 00:11:07.042
Tanaka didn't even walk you home.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.543
It's fine.

00:11:08.752 --> 00:11:10.754
I have something to do at home today.

00:11:20.055 --> 00:11:21.890
Are you sure about this, Sakai?

00:11:22.098 --> 00:11:23.058
Yeah.

00:11:23.266 --> 00:11:25.393
That's what I want from them.

00:11:25.602 --> 00:11:29.231
You don't want them involved in this?

00:11:29.439 --> 00:11:31.274
Maybe not.

00:11:33.652 --> 00:11:35.654
Sakai-kun...

00:11:35.862 --> 00:11:37.280
What?

00:11:37.864 --> 00:11:40.742
Are you sure you
don't want to go home?

00:11:40.951 --> 00:11:42.369
Your dad's there now.

00:11:42.577 --> 00:11:45.664
If you say you're
a friend of ours, well...

00:11:45.872 --> 00:11:47.666
Even if they don't
remember you, you can--

00:11:47.874 --> 00:11:48.917
Thank you.

00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:52.003
But I can't go in.

00:11:53.964 --> 00:11:58.260
If you didn't want to go home,
Sakai, what are you doing here?

00:11:58.468 --> 00:12:00.887
Didn't Sato tell you?

00:12:01.096 --> 00:12:03.473
That I'm making a
paradise for the Denizens?

00:12:03.682 --> 00:12:06.184
Xanadu, right?

00:12:06.393 --> 00:12:07.269
Yes.

00:12:07.477 --> 00:12:10.730
I thought I'd do it here, in Misaki City.

00:12:10.939 --> 00:12:12.399
Remember what I told you,

00:12:12.607 --> 00:12:13.650
Yoshida-san?

00:12:13.859 --> 00:12:17.279
"I haven't changed anything yet, but..."

00:12:17.487 --> 00:12:19.281
After that, I did a lot of things.

00:12:19.489 --> 00:12:21.157
Many, many things.

00:12:21.366 --> 00:12:23.702
And the preparations are nearly complete.

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.871
So I came for the final requirement...

00:12:26.079 --> 00:12:27.914
Your help.

00:12:29.708 --> 00:12:32.127
You're not only taking Shana-chan,

00:12:32.335 --> 00:12:34.212
but Yoshida-san, too?

00:12:34.421 --> 00:12:39.634
Yuji Sakai's plan absolutely
requires Yoshida-san's cooperation.

00:12:39.843 --> 00:12:41.136
But...

00:12:41.344 --> 00:12:44.055
You're right. It may be too sudden.

00:12:45.307 --> 00:12:47.934
I know it's cold,

00:12:48.143 --> 00:12:50.770
but until Yoshida-san
calms down and agrees,

00:12:50.979 --> 00:12:53.023
want to take a walk?

00:12:53.231 --> 00:12:55.233
And you won't take her away?

00:12:55.442 --> 00:12:56.651
No.

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:59.195
If there's anything you
want to know about, I'll tell you.

00:12:59.404 --> 00:13:01.031
There's still time,

00:13:01.239 --> 00:13:04.200
and I'd like to hear you talk.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:09.331
Hey...

00:13:09.539 --> 00:13:12.167
Back then, what
happened to that enemy boss?

00:13:12.375 --> 00:13:13.543
He's here.

00:13:13.752 --> 00:13:15.086
Right here.

00:13:15.295 --> 00:13:18.673
How much of you is Sakai,
and how much is him?

00:13:18.882 --> 00:13:21.968
I'd prefer if you called him the
Creator God or the Snake of the Festival.

00:13:22.177 --> 00:13:24.554
He's actually pretty important.

00:13:25.764 --> 00:13:28.433
I suppose we've merged.

00:13:28.642 --> 00:13:30.101
The Snake of the Festival

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:33.188
has never been interested in
anything but his reason for existence.

00:13:33.396 --> 00:13:36.900
He doesn't like to interfere
with others' plans or actions.

00:13:37.108 --> 00:13:38.318
The fact that he dwells within me

00:13:38.526 --> 00:13:41.696
but I can still refer to him
as "him" proves this, right?

00:13:41.905 --> 00:13:44.407
I think I get it. Maybe...

00:13:44.616 --> 00:13:48.411
Well, all I saw was
you acting really arrogant.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:51.998
Anyway, the one thing
that's always on his mind

00:13:52.207 --> 00:13:54.125
is granting someone's wish.

00:13:54.334 --> 00:13:55.460
Hmm.

00:13:55.669 --> 00:13:59.881
Whenever he's discussing that,
he gets a bit talkative.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:03.718
They're both gods,
but he's very different from Alastor.

00:14:03.927 --> 00:14:05.720
Alastor-san...

00:14:05.929 --> 00:14:08.223
Then you're gonna
fight against Shana-chan?

00:14:08.431 --> 00:14:09.724
Yes. That's how it ended up.

00:14:09.933 --> 00:14:11.559
But you're still doing it?

00:14:11.768 --> 00:14:13.228
Yes, I'm still doing it.

00:14:13.436 --> 00:14:15.897
Is it for her sake?

00:14:16.106 --> 00:14:18.441
For her sake and everyone's, I think.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.236
Is that really what you think?

00:14:21.444 --> 00:14:23.905
That's what I think, if nothing else.

00:14:24.114 --> 00:14:27.283
Even despite what
you're doing to Shana-chan?

00:14:27.492 --> 00:14:30.912
I don't expect you to understand
everything immediately.

00:14:31.121 --> 00:14:34.833
And now you're going to
use Yoshida-san for this, too?

00:14:40.422 --> 00:14:42.424
Do you need me?

00:14:47.178 --> 00:14:48.680
Yes.

00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:50.724
I need you.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.980
All right.

00:14:57.188 --> 00:14:58.148
I'll go with you.

00:14:58.356 --> 00:14:59.482
Yoshida-san?

00:14:59.691 --> 00:15:01.901
It's all right, Tanaka-kun.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:05.238
I know I won't be able to refuse him.

00:15:05.447 --> 00:15:10.702
And it's for Sakai-kun's plan, isn't it?

00:15:11.995 --> 00:15:12.871
Yes.

00:15:13.079 --> 00:15:15.373
This is Yuji Sakai's plan.

00:15:18.376 --> 00:15:21.838
Ogata-san hasn't come
to volleyball practice yet?

00:15:22.047 --> 00:15:24.924
She said she had something
to do this afternoon.

00:15:25.133 --> 00:15:26.926
That's why she was able to attend

00:15:27.135 --> 00:15:30.013
your dad's welcome home party.

00:15:30.221 --> 00:15:31.639
I see.

00:15:31.848 --> 00:15:35.769
You're going to turn
this place into a battlefield?

00:15:35.977 --> 00:15:37.979
Like at the Clear Autumn Festival?

00:15:39.314 --> 00:15:40.815
I'm sorry.

00:15:41.024 --> 00:15:42.942
It won't be just here.

00:15:46.571 --> 00:15:49.449
The school, the Mana River...

00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:52.786
And the place where it all began,
where Hirai-san was eaten.

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:58.833
I'll make all of Misaki City
into a battlefield.

00:15:59.042 --> 00:16:01.711
And this time, I'll be the
one who makes it all happen.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.047
Sakai! You...

00:16:04.255 --> 00:16:06.341
Why are you doing this?

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:19.062
I made every preparation I could to
protect everyone from the fight.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.272
If there were going to be any damage,

00:16:21.481 --> 00:16:25.360
I wouldn't have let
Ike or Ogata-san go home.

00:16:26.736 --> 00:16:29.864
I'm prepared to
protect all of Misaki City.

00:16:30.073 --> 00:16:35.537
As far as I can tell, my order that they
not eat anyone in Japan is being upheld.

00:16:35.745 --> 00:16:36.955
But...

00:16:37.372 --> 00:16:41.918
I can't guarantee that it will
continue to be completely safe.

00:16:42.127 --> 00:16:45.755
The Creator God, the Snake of
the Festival, who issued that order,

00:16:45.964 --> 00:16:48.967
is a God who affirms all desire.

00:16:49.175 --> 00:16:53.763
You could say that the Denizens
underestimate the Snake of the Festival.

00:16:53.972 --> 00:16:59.811
"He's an innocent and optimistic God,
who affirms desire, so he'll forgive us,"

00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:01.855
they think.

00:17:02.063 --> 00:17:04.315
So at first, I was uncertain

00:17:04.524 --> 00:17:09.737
of how willingly
they'd follow his injunction.

00:17:09.946 --> 00:17:11.364
However...

00:17:19.497 --> 00:17:21.249
It appears that paradise

00:17:21.457 --> 00:17:24.544
is an enticing proposition
to all Denizens.

00:17:24.752 --> 00:17:27.297
That reward, or perhaps you'd say "bait,"

00:17:27.505 --> 00:17:30.341
has calmed them down.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:35.180
But I don't know what will
happen once paradise is created.

00:17:35.388 --> 00:17:36.389
For now,

00:17:36.598 --> 00:17:39.559
I merely need to observe them,
killing any who disobey.

00:17:40.226 --> 00:17:42.562
I've ordered that done.

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:45.899
Fortunately, I haven't
heard of any reports yet.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:51.779
Yuji Sakai will grant their wish,

00:17:51.988 --> 00:17:54.365
but he must be strict.

00:17:54.574 --> 00:17:58.203
Both for what is now here,
and for what is to come.

00:17:58.411 --> 00:18:00.330
Yuji Sakai's plan...

00:18:01.789 --> 00:18:05.960
...is a tightrope walk
between the tiny gears

00:18:06.169 --> 00:18:11.174
of the vast machine
that is paradise's creation.

00:18:11.382 --> 00:18:15.762
It's all limited to what the
Snake of the Festival's body can do.

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:20.725
I see.

00:18:20.934 --> 00:18:25.647
Like myself, Sakai now
understands his own powerlessness.

00:18:25.855 --> 00:18:28.316
But he fights anyway.

00:18:28.524 --> 00:18:31.611
Sakai is trying
to accomplish something.

00:18:33.529 --> 00:18:36.241
Sakai's trying to fulfill his goal,

00:18:36.449 --> 00:18:39.827
just like Shana-chan is
trying to fulfill hers.

00:18:41.329 --> 00:18:45.208
Does that mean those two must fight?

00:18:45.416 --> 00:18:46.709
I see...

00:18:46.918 --> 00:18:48.795
Just like the two of them,

00:18:49.003 --> 00:18:52.257
Yoshida-san intends
to fight, as well.

00:18:57.178 --> 00:19:00.932
The Snake of the Festival, the Creator God,
once attempted to create a walled garden,

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:04.519
a place for the Denizens in this world.

00:19:04.727 --> 00:19:06.938
But he was banished to the Rift.

00:19:08.481 --> 00:19:10.608
Thousands of years later,

00:19:10.817 --> 00:19:13.361
the desire held by
the Denizens had changed

00:19:13.569 --> 00:19:17.907
to a world just like this,
right down to its people.

00:19:18.116 --> 00:19:21.911
So the Creator God

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:26.165
wishes to create a
world identical to this one,

00:19:26.374 --> 00:19:29.419
in the space between worlds.

00:19:29.627 --> 00:19:32.755
Like a parallel world.

00:19:32.964 --> 00:19:35.591
A world identical to this one...

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:38.177
Will that work?

00:19:38.386 --> 00:19:43.349
Isn't that rift filled with storms?

00:19:43.558 --> 00:19:45.393
It will be fine.

00:19:45.601 --> 00:19:48.938
Mass and distance
have no meaning there.

00:19:49.147 --> 00:19:54.193
Even an entire universe's
creation will not affect it.

00:19:55.695 --> 00:19:58.990
There is another reason
for the chaos there.

00:19:59.198 --> 00:20:01.159
It's almost time.

00:20:01.367 --> 00:20:02.744
After a long while,

00:20:02.952 --> 00:20:06.456
they decided they
wanted the world as it was.

00:20:06.664 --> 00:20:10.877
Not as an empty playground,
containing nothing but themselves.

00:20:11.085 --> 00:20:16.716
But a world they could
create by living with humans.

00:20:16.924 --> 00:20:20.511
The result of the Denizens
learning about this world,

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:23.306
spending their time with humans,
and wanting a world like it

00:20:23.514 --> 00:20:26.851
is that a world like
this one will be created.

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:28.353
And there,

00:20:28.561 --> 00:20:32.190
I shall have them take
a step forward, on a long path.

00:20:33.691 --> 00:20:38.237
And soon, Shana and
the others will come to stop me.

00:20:39.864 --> 00:20:42.492
I will never let them.

00:20:42.992 --> 00:20:46.496
I'll stop them, complete
my task, and then it will begin.

00:20:46.704 --> 00:20:47.914
Sakai,

00:20:48.122 --> 00:20:50.792
why don't you tell Shana-chan
everything you just told me?

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.251
Maybe...

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.378
It's impossible.

00:20:53.586 --> 00:20:55.129
Why?

00:20:55.338 --> 00:20:58.466
Shana would never agree

00:20:58.674 --> 00:21:01.636
to a vague, optimistic plan.

00:21:02.845 --> 00:21:07.183
Even if they all knew what Yuji Sakai
is attempting with this paradise,

00:21:07.392 --> 00:21:09.477
they'd never let it sway their opinion.

00:21:10.311 --> 00:21:13.439
So the winner of this
fight will get what they want.

00:21:13.648 --> 00:21:16.275
That's the only way.

00:21:16.484 --> 00:21:20.571
You two really...

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.782
<i>Sate contacted you, fight'?</i>

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:26.327
Shana and the others
will arrive in several hours.

00:21:26.327 --> 00:21:27.662
<i>The moon and stars
are illuminating me</i>

00:21:27.662 --> 00:21:29.455
This time, it'd be better if you ran.

00:21:29.455 --> 00:21:31.332
<i>On top of the carpet
with dancing sparks</i>

00:21:31.332 --> 00:21:32.792
I'm not running.

00:21:32.792 --> 00:21:34.877
<i>You are right in front of me,
glowing red in the light</i>

00:21:34.961 --> 00:21:37.547
tell Sato everything I've heard,

00:21:37.547 --> 00:21:38.631
<i>Your honest eyes are twinkling</i>

00:21:38.631 --> 00:21:41.217
ditch this bookmark,
eat dinner, and go to bed.

00:21:41.217 --> 00:21:42.176
<i>The two footsteps, they head
toward the distant yonder</i>

00:21:42.176 --> 00:21:44.470
If you're really
as certain as you sound,

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.973
<i>The words I told you said,
"Let's leave everything behind"</i>

00:21:46.973 --> 00:21:47.306
protect me and everyone else!

00:21:47.306 --> 00:21:52.395
<i>Fly toward the future</i>

00:21:52.395 --> 00:21:53.229
Yes.

00:21:53.229 --> 00:21:57.024
<i>The motive has a strong grasp on my
heart Yes, this is the ultimate descent</i>

00:21:57.024 --> 00:22:00.111
You only spent a year or
so with everyone, but was it fun?

00:22:00.111 --> 00:22:00.736
<i>The two of us are fellow soldiers
flattering one another's pulses</i>

00:22:00.736 --> 00:22:02.780
I had a really good time.

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:03.865
<i>If you are going to protect your love,
you cannot reject battle</i>

00:22:03.865 --> 00:22:04.532
Yeah.

00:22:04.532 --> 00:22:07.535
<i>Without fudging a phrase,
we rhyme down this hot path</i>

00:22:07.535 --> 00:22:08.411
It was all fun, like a dream.

00:22:08.411 --> 00:22:11.205
<i>Passing each other by, quarreling</i>

00:22:11.205 --> 00:22:14.459
I thought about punching you
when I saw you, but...

00:22:14.459 --> 00:22:14.917
<i>Set free from the enchantment</i>

00:22:15.126 --> 00:22:18.296
<i>If you are going to leave on a journey,</i>

00:22:18.504 --> 00:22:22.133
<i>I will never let go of your hand again</i>

00:22:22.341 --> 00:22:25.636
<i>Do you still remember the first time</i>

00:22:25.845 --> 00:22:29.265
<i>Our eyes locked, just as it happened?</i>

00:22:29.474 --> 00:22:32.602
<i>Even if I am engulfed
by the vortex of slumber,</i>

00:22:32.602 --> 00:22:33.728
Let's go, Sakai-kun.

00:22:33.728 --> 00:22:38.483
<i>It will not vanish,
I won't let it--It's our dream</i>

00:22:38.483 --> 00:22:40.776
At first, I was pushing myself.

00:22:40.776 --> 00:22:43.988
<i>With an unfaltering voice, you make sure</i>

00:22:43.988 --> 00:22:45.364
But when I learned
that you're still Sakai-kun,

00:22:45.364 --> 00:22:47.074
<i>To keep the tiny scrap
of paper from burning asunder</i>

00:22:47.074 --> 00:22:48.784
it made me feel a little better.

00:22:48.784 --> 00:22:51.162
<i>I won't forget about you,
even if my body vanishes</i>

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.624
<i>I will remember how we lived together</i>

00:22:54.624 --> 00:22:55.875
You may be overestimating me.

00:22:55.875 --> 00:22:58.336
<i>Snow of light flutters down the sky</i>

00:22:58.336 --> 00:22:58.878
But I'm not lying about any of this.

00:22:58.878 --> 00:23:02.048
<i>Where the waning
moon and stars go to snuggle</i>

00:23:02.256 --> 00:23:05.343
<i>The story we are writing</i>

00:23:05.551 --> 00:23:08.846
<i>Will continue on even
after this, for all eternity</i>

00:23:09.055 --> 00:23:13.059
<i>If you are going to clearly protect
your love, you cannot reject battle</i>

00:23:13.267 --> 00:23:18.523
<i>Without fudging a phrase, we rhyme
as we travel down overlapping paths</i>

00:23:18.731 --> 00:23:25.154
<i>The moment we discovered the conclusion,
time merely continued to move on</i>

00:23:25.363 --> 00:23:29.116
<i>As the snow of light flurries down</i>

00:23:31.994 --> 00:23:33.955
Yoshida is welcomed
to the Palace of the Stars,

00:23:34.163 --> 00:23:36.415
where she learns of
her role in Xanadu's creation.

00:23:36.624 --> 00:23:39.293
In Misaki City, where the
Denizens gather, protected by Ball Masque,

00:23:39.502 --> 00:23:42.213
Yuji and Shana begin their final battle.

00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:44.507
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:44.715 --> 00:23:45.841
"Maelstrom of Conflict."
